---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Receipt from "@/components/receipts/Receipt.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  kicker="Prototype"
  title="Receipts"
  intro="Every claim, linked to the artifact that proves it."
>
  <section class="receipts-demo stack stack-l">

    <div class="prose measure">
      <p>Stephanie Jarmak is an information scientist and AI agent advocate whose research spans
        planetary science and machine intelligence. She <Receipt
          id="cassini-rings"
          kind="paper"
          source="Jarmak et al. 2022 — Solar occultation observations of Saturn's rings with Cassini UVIS (Icarus)"
          url="https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S001910352200330X"
        >co-authored peer-reviewed planetary science from Cassini ring occultations</Receipt>,
        and <Receipt
          id="scix-llm-embeddings"
          kind="paper"
          source="Blanco-Cuaresma, Ciucă, Accomazzi, Jarmak et al. 2023 — Experimenting with LLMs and vector embeddings in NASA SciX (arXiv:2312.14211)"
          url="https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.14211"
        >published work on LLM embeddings for scientific literature search</Receipt>
        at NASA's Astrophysics Data System. Her transition from telescope to terminal has been
        recognised in kind: <Receipt
          id="asteroid-stephaniejarmak"
          kind="press"
          source="WGSBN Bulletin Vol. 3, No. 9 — Asteroid (30232) Stephaniejarmak, IAU / JPL Small-Body Database"
          url="https://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/tools/sbdb_lookup.html#/?sstr=30232"
        >she has an asteroid named after her</Receipt>
        by the International Astronomical Union, in recognition of her work on asteroid spectroscopy,
        regolith adhesion, and planetesimal formation.</p>

      <p>Today Stephanie builds tools at the frontier of AI-assisted software development. She <Receipt
          id="codescalebench"
          kind="repo"
          source="CodeScaleBench — 370 tasks across 20 suites for evaluating AI coding agents on large, enterprise-scale codebases (GitHub: sjarmak/CodeScaleBench)"
          url="https://github.com/sjarmak/CodeScaleBench"
        >built CodeScaleBench for evaluating agents on large-scale software</Receipt>,
        covering 9 developer work types with auditable per-task traces and dual-verifier support.
        She also <Receipt
          id="sourcegraph-software-factory-webinar"
          kind="talk"
          source="Sourcegraph Webinar — Building a Software Factory (June 2026)"
          url="https://sourcegraph.com/webinars/building-a-software-factory-06032026"
        >gave a Sourcegraph webinar on building a software factory with AI agents</Receipt>,
        and runs the <Receipt
          id="code-intelligence-digest"
          kind="repo"
          source="Code Intelligence Digest — weekly curated digest using hybrid LLM + BM25 + recency ranking (GitHub: sjarmak/code-intelligence-digest)"
          url="https://github.com/sjarmak/code-intelligence-digest"
        >Code Intelligence Digest</Receipt>,
        a weekly curation of what's moving in code intelligence and autonomous agents.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legend cluster" aria-label="Chip glyph legend">
      <span class="legend__label">Chip glyphs:</span>
      <span class="legend__item"><span class="legend__glyph">◆</span> Paper</span>
      <span class="legend__item"><span class="legend__glyph">⌥</span> Repository</span>
      <span class="legend__item"><span class="legend__glyph">⊞</span> Dataset</span>
      <span class="legend__item"><span class="legend__glyph">▷</span> Talk / Webinar</span>
      <span class="legend__item"><span class="legend__glyph">✦</span> Post</span>
      <span class="legend__item"><span class="legend__glyph">★</span> Recognition</span>
    </div>

  </section>
</PageLayout>

<script>
  import "@/scripts/receipts";
</script>

<style>
  .receipts-demo {
    padding-block: var(--space-l) var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }

  .legend {
    --cluster-gap: var(--space-s);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    padding: var(--space-xs) var(--space-s);
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    border: var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .legend__label {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: calc(var(--step--1) * 0.9);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
  }

  .legend__item {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .legend__glyph {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }
</style>
